# ─── EmailJS Configuration ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Required to send admin invite emails from the browser (free tier, no backend needed).
#
# Setup steps:
#  1. Go to https://emailjs.com and create a free account
#  2. Add Email Service: Connect your Gmail → copy the Service ID
#  3. Create Email Template with these variables:
#       {{to_email}}   — recipient's email address
#       {{to_name}}    — recipient's name (part before @)
#       {{invited_by}} — name of the admin who sent the invite
#       {{role}}       — assigned role (e.g. "SUPPORT", "ADMIN")
#       {{invite_link}} — link to accept (https://takeoutfix.pages.dev/tool)
#       {{expires_at}} — expiry date/time string
#  4. Copy Template ID → paste below
#  5. Go to Account > API Keys → copy Public Key → paste below
#
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=service_xxxxxxx
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=template_xxxxxxx
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
